00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:58.620
It is still there, and she has tons of photos.

313
00:13:59.140 --> 00:13:59.820
Amazing.

314
00:14:00.340 --> 00:14:05.860
She also gave this amazing breakdown of what it was like to be a background performer

315
00:14:05.860 --> 00:14:06.920
on Company Picnic.

316
00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:08.740
Oh my gosh, are you going to share?

317
00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:09.280
Yes.

318
00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:15.580
You guys, Jenny was sort of someone who made a community for The Office online before anyone

319
00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.400
was doing that.

320
00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.520
Before social media.

321
00:14:17.760 --> 00:14:18.720
Before social media.

322
00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:24.600
And she was there for the show, providing this community in our earliest days when we didn't

323
00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:25.980
even know the future of the show.

324
00:14:26.280 --> 00:14:28.920
And it meant a lot to all of us.

325
00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:34.860
And we would reach out to her and give her exclusive tips or content or photos that she

326
00:14:34.860 --> 00:14:37.300
would post on the website, and it became kind of the hub.

327
00:14:37.760 --> 00:14:38.020
Yeah.

328
00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:44.000
And this was before networks did any kind of social media or website for any of their shows.

329
00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:46.720
And our show had this presence because of Jenny.

330
00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:54.220
And so her documenting of our show is very extensive, and it's all still there on officetally.com.

