338
00:15:24.500 --> 00:15:24.920
Oh, yeah.

339
00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:29.700
I remember doing background work, and there was a guy that had a backpack that was a chair.

340
00:15:30.020 --> 00:15:30.460
Yes.

