356
00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:26.940
She said they were thrilled to be working on our show because we had a reputation for treating

357
00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:30.700
background performers very, very well and for providing great food.

358
00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:36.720
She said one person told her from a work perspective, to be able to be an extra on the office for

359
00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:39.060
an entire week, I feel like I won the lottery.

360
00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:42.140
So that made me really proud that our show did a good job.

361
00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:46.100
Because as a person who did a lot of background work, yeah.

362
00:16:46.440 --> 00:16:46.760
Yeah.

363
00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:47.900
It meant a lot.

364
00:16:48.280 --> 00:16:52.420
Usually the background performers were like the last people who get to go through the lunch

