368
00:17:07.900 --> 00:17:09.020
And it was awesome.

369
00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:11.020
Well, you know, that's Randy Cordray.

370
00:17:11.800 --> 00:17:13.560
Randy took care of everyone.

371
00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:17.720
However you were a part of our show, he was going to make sure you were taken care of.

372
00:17:18.020 --> 00:17:19.500
That is absolutely true, lady.

373
00:17:19.940 --> 00:17:20.880
All right, lady.

